-  V0 membership mvp at members.greatfallstoolbus.org is in alpha.   Apply, tour, decision, agreement etc flow


<img src="/diagrams/launch-member-v0/member-lifecycle.svg" alt="Member lifecycle: submit application, verify email, keyholder claims and tours, one keyholder decides, then assent leads to active, paused, left, or removed." />

**What happens after you're active.** Contributions and other extras stay optional, and separate from membership itself.  

<img src="/diagrams/launch-member-v0/member-projection-flow.svg" alt="Member projection flow: active membership branches into an optional contribution offer (no contribution, cash or check, or Stripe when live gates pass) and an optional projection queue for mailing list and mailbox, none of which change membership." />
